'''Capone's Jail''' (カポネの監獄 ''Kapone no Kangoku'', ''lit. '''Capone's Prison''''') is the 19th sub-chapter of [[Legend Stages|Stories of Legend]]. It was added in [[Version 2.9.1 Update|Version 2.9.1]] and is available up to {{4c}} difficulty. In [[The Battle Cats Unite!]], it is the 12th sub-chapter in the Stories of Legend and is available up to 3★ difficulty.

==Difficulty==
This sub-chapter, while easier than [[Jail Break Tunnel]] for some, introduces [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] enemies. [[Stilts Cat (Rare Cat)|Stilts Cat]], [[Juliet Cat (Super Rare Cat)|Juliet Cat]] and [[Cat Toaster (Super Rare Cat)|Cat Toaster]] are not recommended against any of the Angel enemies found here, but [[Rocker Cat (Rare Cat)|Rocker Cat]] and [[Ancient Heroes ULTRA SOULS (Gacha Event)|ULTRA SOULS]] units will help massively.  The hardest stages are [[King of Freedom]], which contains a [[Camelle]] and a large horde of [[Master A.]], and [[Pigpen Taboo]], which has three [[Dober P.D]]s and three [[Shadow Boxer K]]s.
{{LegendDiff|150|170|140}}

==New Features==
This sub-chapter introduces three new enemies:
*[[Heavenly Hippoe]]: An [[:Category:Angel Enemies|Angel]] variant of [[Hippoe]] that has fairly high health, but somewhat low attack power.
*[[Gabriel]]: An Angel variant of [[Doge]] with high health for a peon, decent attack power, many knockbacks and incredibly fast movement speed, akin to [[Doge Dark]]. While his range is lower, his Area Attacks can punch through groups of small meatshields easily.
*[[Angelic Gory]]: A faster and stronger Angel version of [[Gory]], but acts more similarly to [[Gory Dark]].

